<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Pati9.91">
        <l>kuṭṭuva ṉirumpoṟaikku maiyūr kiḻāaṉ</l>
        <l>vēṇmā ḷantuvañ ceḷḷai yīṉṟamakaṉ</l>
        <l>veruvaru tāṉaiyoṭu veytuṟac ceytuceṉ</l>
        <l>ṟiruperu vēntarum vicciyum vīḻa</l>
        <l>varumiḷaik kallakat tainteyi leṟintu</l>
        <l>potti yāṇṭa peruñcō ḻaṉaiyum</l>
        <l>vittai yāṇṭaviḷam paḻaiyaṉ māṟaṉaiyum</l>
        <l>vaitta veñciṉam vāyppa veṉṟu</l>
        <l>vañci mūtūrt tantupiṟark kutavi</l>
        <l>mantira marapiṟ ṟeyvam pēṇi</l>
        <l>meyyū ramaicciyaṉ maiyūr kiḻāṉaip</l>
        <l>puraiyaṟu kēḷvip purōcu mayakki</l>
        <l>yaruntiṟaṉ marapiṟ peruñcatuk kamarnta</l>
        <l>ventiṟaṟ pūtarait tantiva ṇiṟīi</l>
        <l>yāynta marapiṟ cānti vēṭṭu</l>
        <l>maṉṉuyir kātta maṟuvil ceṅkō</l>
        <l>liṉṉicai muraci ṉiruñcēra lirumpoṟaiyaip</l>
        <l>peruṅkuṉṟūr kiḻār pāṭiṉār pattuppāṭṭu.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>translation line</l>
        <l>translation line</l>
      </lg>
    </div>

    <div rend="parallel">
    <p xml:id="Pati9.91coda1">
      avaitām niḻalviṭu kaṭṭi, viṉainavil yāṉai, paḵṟōṟ ṟoḻuti, toḻi ṉavil yāṉai, nāṭukā ṇeṭuvarai, ventiṟaṟ ṟaṭakkai, veṇṭalaic cempu ṉal, kalkāl kavaṇai, tuvarāk kūntal, valikeḻu taṭakkai; ivai pāṭṭiṉ patikam.
     </p>
     <p xml:lang="en">translation</p>
    </div>
    
    <div rend="parallel">
     <p xml:id="Pati9.91coda2">
      pāṭip peṟṟa paricil: maruḷillārkku maruḷak koṭukkaveṉṟu uvakaiyiṉ muppattīrāyiraṅ kāṇam koṭuttu avar aṟiyāmai ūrum maṉaiyum vaḷamikap paṭaittu ērum iṉpamum iyalvarap parappi eṇṇaṟku ākā aruṅkala veṟuk kaiyoṭu paṉṉūṟāyiram pāṟpaṭa vakuttuk kāppumaṟam tāṉviṭṭāṉ akkō. kuṭakkō iḷañcēralirumpoṟai patiṉāṟāṇṭu vīṟṟiruntāṉ.
     </p>
     <p xml:lang="en">translation</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>

